            <Box style={{ borderLeft: '4px solid #22D3EE', background: 'rgba(34,211,238,0.07)', borderRadius: '0 10px 10px 0', padding: 16 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0A1D37' }}>投资人看到</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#0F2039', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 6 }}>可复制的产品闭环——同一套 Harness 结构，可迁移到其他时序预测场景。</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, marginTop: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ padding: '3px 10px', border: '1px solid #22D3EE', borderRadius: 6 }}>
